note as BIZ_diagram_40_auth_providers
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Generic, provider-adaptable federated login and user provisioning. Registers
  identity providers (OIDC, SAML 2.0, OAuth2, social, enterprise) with their protocol
  configuration and signing keys, binds them per tenant with auto-provisioning rules,
  maps external claims to platform attributes, links external subjects to platform
  users, and records every login attempt for security. Extends iam
  (authentication_credentials.identity_provider) into a first-class, configurable
  federation layer; distinct from module 27 identity_assurance (proofing/IAL/AAL).
end note

