note as DEP_diagram_40_auth_providers
  Connects to other modules via:
  iam.users (federated_identities.user_id), iam.authentication_credentials,
  directory.tenants, authz.roles (default/assign role concepts resolve here),
  common.files (logo), identity_assurance.identity_assertions (AAL/FAL linkage),
  terminology.catalog_concepts.
end note

note as REC_AUTHP_diagram_40_auth_providers
  FEDERATION SECURITY
  Secrets are references (client_secret_ref) to a vault, never stored inline.
  external_subject is unique per provider (UK). federated_login_attempts is
  append-only and complements iam.security_events. Auto-provisioning must respect
  provider_tenant_bindings + provisioning_rules; AAL/FAL is asserted via module 27.
end note


